<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>MacMenuBar.com (中文)</title><link>https://macmenubar.com</link><description>超过1500个Mac菜单栏应用的精选目录</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 26 Jul 2026 08:34:28 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>凯酮</title><link>https://macmenubar.com/keytones/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/keytones_2.webp"&gt;&lt;img alt="Keytones" height="441" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/keytones_2.webp" width="600"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;为每一次按键添加可自定义的音频反馈，字母、修饰键和空格键拥有不同的声音。Keytones 能帮助捕捉意外的 Caps Lock 和 Shift 按键，同时提供可选的视觉反馈。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.subclassed.com/keytones/keyboard-sounds-and-effects.html" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="blank"&gt;访问&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 26 Jul 2026 08:34:28 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>在线</title><link>https://macmenubar.com/online/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/online.webp"&gt;&lt;img alt="Online" height="343" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/online.webp" width="450"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Online 通过分层连接检测 quietly 监控你的网络连接，识别出超出简单 Wi-Fi 状态的真正中断。它会找出可能原因，记录中断情况，并在一切正常时保持低调，及时发送提醒。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Jubblin/online" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="blank"&gt;访问&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 26 Jul 2026 02:47:19 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>横梁挂钩</title><link>https://macmenubar.com/beamhook/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/beamhook.webp"&gt;&lt;img alt="Beamhook" height="784" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/beamhook.webp" width="1340"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beamhook 让您掌控 Mac 的媒体键，将播放、暂停、下一首、上一首，以及可选的音量控制，直接路由到您选择的应用程序。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://beamhook.app/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="blank"&gt;访问网站&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 18:43:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>不慌乱</title><link>https://macmenubar.com/unfumble/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/unfumble.webp"&gt;&lt;img alt="Unfumble" height="495" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/unfumble.webp" width="425"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unfumble 会在您输入时自动切换键盘布局并纠正打字错误。专为多语言用户打造，它能保持正确的输入源处于激活状态，带来更流畅、无挫败感的工作流程。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://unfumble.app/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="blank"&gt;访问网站&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 11:36:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>出发时刻</title><link>https://macmenubar.com/timetogo/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/timetogo_1.webp"&gt;&lt;img alt="TimeToGo" height="651" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/timetogo_1.webp" width="450"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;TimeToGo 通过实时交通更新帮助你规划通勤，显示预计出行时间和出发提醒。设置路线、时间阈值和日程，精准掌握出发时机。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/timetogo-3-avoid-traffic/id6758940999" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="blank"&gt;访问&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 09:08:56 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>